{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"ECHO","artist":"Crusher","date":"2026-08-01","sourceId":"14489268:010","sourceHash":"6355d727c83257aa31284edc08f1d019374798a5bc765817e2c0b5ec6096983c","duration":235.60000000000036,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":11.227834,"end":14.645,"text":"The clock stopped ticking forever ago","translation":"시계는 아주 오래전에 멈춰 버렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":15.057972,"end":17.198051,"text":"How long have I been up?","translation":"난 얼마나 오래 깨어 있던 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":17.218051,"end":18.07523,"text":"I don't know","translation":"나도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":18.348091,"end":21.465,"text":"I can't get a grip, but I can't let go","translation":"정신을 다잡을 수 없지만 놓을 수도 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":21.89822,"end":25.195,"text":"There wasn't anything to hold on to though","translation":"붙잡을 건 아무것도 없었는데","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":25.388346,"end":28.895,"text":"Why can't I see, why can't I see","translation":"왜 난 못 보는 걸까 왜 난 못 보는 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":29.09848,"end":32.035,"text":"All the colors that you see?","translation":"네가 보는 모든 색을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":32.4186,"end":35.755,"text":"Please can I be, please can I be","translation":"제발 나도 될 수 있을까 제발 나도 될 수 있을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":36.018731,"end":38.455,"text":"Colorful and free? Yeah","translation":"다채롭고 자유롭게 그래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":38.888834,"end":40.798904,"text":"What the hell's going on?","translation":"도대체 무슨 일이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":40.818904,"end":42.355,"text":"Can someone tell me please","translation":"누가 좀 말해 줄래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":42.618969,"end":45.919089,"text":"Why I'm switching faster than the channels on TV?","translation":"왜 난 TV 채널보다 더 빨리 바뀌는 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":45.939089,"end":47.439154,"text":"I'm black, then I'm white","translation":"난 검었다가 하얘져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":47.479145,"end":49.139931,"text":"No, something isn't right","translation":"아니 뭔가 잘못됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":49.179207,"end":52.709335,"text":"My enemy's invisible, I don't know how to fight","translation":"내 적은 보이지 않아 어떻게 싸울지 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":52.729335,"end":56.586644,"text":"The trembling fear is more than I can take","translation":"몸을 떨게 하는 공포는 감당할 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":56.609475,"end":59.595,"text":"When I'm up against the echo in the mirror","translation":"거울 속 메아리와 맞설 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":59.76959,"end":63.894768,"text":"Echo","translation":"메아리","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":135.132315,"end":136.952382,"text":"I'm gonna burn my house down","translation":"내 집을 태워버릴래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":136.972382,"end":138.235,"text":"Into an ugly black","translation":"흉측하게 새까매지도록","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":138.422434,"end":140.145,"text":"I'm gonna run away now","translation":"이제 난 도망칠래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":140.362505,"end":141.594701,"text":"And never look back","translation":"절대 뒤돌아보지 않을래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":141.722554,"end":143.862632,"text":"I'm gonna burn my house down","translation":"내 집을 태워버릴래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":143.882632,"end":145.061254,"text":"Into an ugly black","translation":"흉측하게 새까매지도록","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":145.122677,"end":147.40276,"text":"I'm gonna run away now","translation":"이제 난 도망칠래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":147.42276,"end":148.495,"text":"And never look back","translation":"절대 뒤돌아보지 않을래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":148.662805,"end":150.698607,"text":"I'm gonna burn my house down","translation":"내 집을 태워버릴래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":150.74288,"end":151.905,"text":"Into an ugly black","translation":"흉측하게 새까매지도록","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":152.082928,"end":154.053,"text":"I'm gonna run away now","translation":"이제 난 도망칠래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":154.073,"end":155.365,"text":"And never look back","translatio